add('## Carried applications');add();c=m['carried']['corrected'];add(f"{c['initialized']:,} initialized; {c['active_apps']} active; {c['events']} May rows; {c['ptp_apps']} PTP; {c['expiry_apps']:,} expired; {c['inactive_expiry_apps']:,} expired inactive. Corrected-v1: 37 active, 217 rows, 16 PTP. The audited late-age historical PTP risk has no positive outcomes; corrected-v2 removes unsupported independent-clock PTP rather than preserving that artificial activity.");add();add('Residual survival conditions on weekday/source/age/silence/depth with >=30 unique historical applications and deterministic fallback. Fine near-expiry age bins separate hours from several days of remaining validity. Donors are censored at their exact expiry; the sampled event then competes with the target expiry, avoiding double expiry suppression. One residual draw is persisted per carried episode.');add();add(f"Same Phase 2 Friday/depth benchmark: observed {ci['observed_active']}, expected {ci['expected_active']:.2f}, predictive interval {ci['approx_95pct_predictive_interval']}. Original April1 Wednesday comparison remains separately reported and higher: {m['carried']['matched_april1']['corrected']}. The weekday-sensitive primary gap is a remaining limitation, not a reason to force activity.");add()
